{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>All</b> — He mentioned your nearby enemies and said: <b>all the earth</b>. And there is no difference between יזמרו לך (they sing to you) and ויזמרו לך (and they shall sing to you), and the meaning is doubled."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:49.398964733Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}